{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2019b.q24.material.recovered", "text": "材料：下面是某教师编制的一道材料分析题：材料：洋务派的“自强”，有两重含义：其一，从阶级意义上说，它寻求的是在农民战争打击下的王朝自救；其二，从民族意义上来说，是为了抵御外国资本主义的侵略，实现民族的自我图强，以“自强”为宗旨，“洋务”成为最大的“时务”“急务”。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "3983157c80ccd0ea29ff197cd687097de2ae10a9a5cf83a278c666c406160ee1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3229, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3361, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "3983157c80ccd0ea29ff197cd687097de2ae10a9a5cf83a278c666c406160ee1"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2019b.q24"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k07", "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.410.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2019b.q24"], "word_count": 132, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "3983157c80ccd0ea29ff197cd687097de2ae10a9a5cf83a278c666c406160ee1", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3229, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3361, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "3983157c80ccd0ea29ff197cd687097de2ae10a9a5cf83a278c666c406160ee1"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authori